# ─── Gokul Portfolio — Environment Variables ─────────────────────────
#
# 1. Copy this file to .env:
#       cp .env.example .env
#
# 2. Get your free Resend API key at https://resend.com
#    (Free tier: 100 emails/day, no credit card required)
#
# 3. Paste your key below:
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_resend_api_key_here
#
# 4. Restart the dev server:  npm run dev
#
# ─── Vercel Deployment ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Add RESEND_API_KEY in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
# The api/contact.js serverless function will pick it up automatically.
#
# ─── Notes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# - On Resend free tier, the sender must be: onboarding@resend.dev
# - To use a custom sender (e.g. portfolio@yourdomain.com) you must
#   verify your domain at https://resend.com/domains
# - The recipient is always: this.gokul.s@gmail.com (hardcoded server-side)
# - The API key is NEVER sent to the browser — it stays server-side only.
